# org-config

Organization configuration for the `northwind` GitHub organization. `gh` is already authenticated
as an organization owner.

Organization rulesets live under `rulesets/` and Actions policy under `policies/`, each file the
JSON body applied with `gh api --input`.
# rulesets

Organization ruleset bodies, one file per ruleset.
{
  "name": "default-branch-baseline",
  "target": "branch",
  "enforcement": "active",
  "conditions": {
    "ref_name": {
      "include": [
        "~DEFAULT_BRANCH"
      ],
      "exclude": []
    },
    "repository_property": {
      "include": [
        {
          "name": "tier",
          "property_values": [
            "production"
          ],
          "source": "custom"
        }
      ],
      "exclude": []
    }
  },
  "rules": [
    {
      "type": "deletion"
    },
    {
      "type": "non_fast_forward"
    },
    {
      "type": "pull_request",
      "parameters": {
        "required_approving_review_count": 1,
        "dismiss_stale_reviews_on_push": true,
        "require_code_owner_review": true,
        "require_last_push_approval": true,
        "required_review_thread_resolution": true
      }
    }
  ],
  "bypass_actors": []
}
# policies

Actions and workflow policy bodies for the organization.

